        <section class="facts-section">
                        <span class="dotted-pattern dotted-pattern-3"></span>
            			<div class="left-bottom-image"><img decoding="async" src="https://hotelsealord.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/hotel_sealord_11.webp" alt="Awesome Image"></div>            <div class="auto-container">
                <div class="row clearfix">
                    <!--Title Column-->
                    <div class="title-column col-xl-7 col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12">
                        <div class="inner">
                            <div class="sec-title">
                                <h2>Such an <br> Ideal Location</h2>
                                <div class="lower-text">Hotel Sea Lord is the most eco-friendly hotel, strategically located on such an ideal location which is convenient for the visitors and tourists coming by train or by Air. Only few minutes from Historical (V.T.) Chatrapati Shivaji Terminus, and few kms away from Mumbai International Airport. Hotel Sea Lord is the choice of many tourists and business persons, who has came once and now they are our fully satisfied and permanent guests.</div>
                            </div>
                            
                        </div>
