                                        <h4>Service to Feel Well</h4>
                                        <div class="text">We are ready to serve you with a pleasant smile, warmth words and hospitality which will create an atmosphere better than home, You will feel it.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                                                <div class="fact-block">
                                    <div class="fact-inner">
                                        <div class="fact-count wow zoomInStable" data-wow-delay="0ms" data-wow-duration="2000ms"><div class="count-box"><span class="count-text" data-stop="100" data-speed="2000">0</span>%</div></div>
                                        <h4>Hospitality</h4>
                                        <div class="text">To take care of all your personal needs, our house keeping staff is available 24/7. All the facilities from Laundry, Shoe Shine, Postal services, Courier services are available on a single call.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                                                <div class="fact-block">
                                    <div class="fact-inner">
