                                        <h4>Facilities</h4>
                                        <div class="text">Our rooms are aesthetically designed and tastefully furnished, well maintained, fully air-conditioned and spotlessly clean with latest facilities of reputable brand of fittings and fixtures</div>
                                    </div>
